listing:   f545_main.cc virtio9p.cc p9.cc (kernel f545.elf)
toolchain: QEMU emulator version 8.2.2 (Debian 1:8.2.2+ds-0ubuntu1.18)
command:   qemu-system-x86_64 -machine pc -m 32M -nodefaults -display none -no-reboot -monitor none -device isa-debug-exit,iobase=0xf4,iosize=0x04 -serial stdio -kernel f545.elf -append "node=1 walk=Hello.txt" -fsdev local,id=f0,path=export,security_model=none -device virtio-9p-pci,fsdev=f0,mount_tag=ds403share,disable-modern=on -trace v9fs_*
date:      2026-10-10T00:10:15Z
machine:   Linux x86_64 (cloud build container)
exit code: 33
note:      lines starting with v9fs_ are QEMU's own trace of its 9P server; the others are the kernel's serial output
note:      exit code 33 = the kernel wrote 0x10 to isa-debug-exit
hardware:  untested on hardware; QEMU 8.2.2 with TCG (no KVM), one emulated PC with a virtio-9p-pci device sharing a host directory (no physical counterpart)
